    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>The Callback Button block runs the configured callback function when clicked and can write a value to the bound parameter. Use it to trigger scripted actions from the dashboard.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Output(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no output ports.</p>
